        <activityName xml:lang="en">Branch connections and fittings, steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Branch connections and fittings, steel
Production of steel branch connections and fittings;
UUID: 10b39440-e875-345e-a874-e381f86c4549
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for pipe installations of heating systems in appartment and commercial buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical products used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_10b39440-e875-345e-a874-e381f86c4549.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
